MILESTONE dash 9f4ce27a9919402ba444122e5926fa7d9890f572

Shift now dashes **4.5 m over 10 ticks** in the held direction, or along Rivet’s facing when stationary. The burst exits at **6.75 m/s**, followed by **40 cooldown ticks**. Holding Shift sustains the **9.3 m/s** sprint. The pad sprint keeps its original binding. **No invulnerability was needed**: the 8 m rocket missed by 1.414 m after a 15-tick reaction.

| Attack | Starting ranges | Dash clearance at impact | HP lost standing / dashing |
|---|---|---|---|
| Rocket | 5 / 8 / 12 m | +1.296 / +1.414 / +1.414 m | 10 / 0 at each range |
| Boss stomp | 1.8 / 2.5 / 3.5 m | +1.827 / +2.103 / +2.615 m | 24 / 0 at each range |

The fleeing gauntlet patrol cop measured **3.200 m/s**. Walls, robots and bosses stopped the dash. A head-on human contact above the existing 7.5 m/s tackle threshold triggered 1.6 m knockback and zero damage. [Measurement method and impact ticks](evidence/n24-motion/dash_dodge.md)

| Pursuit input | Mean speed | Time to close 10 m |
|---|---:|---:|
| Plain run | 6.750 m/s | 3.017 s |
| Repeated dash, hold-sprint off | 10.800 m/s | 0.950 s |
| Repeated dash, hold-sprint on | 12.692 m/s | 0.883 s |

